      "content": "thanks for that. one more thing though, i'm still a bit confused about the logic behind the warning itself. you mentioned it's about \"views\" vs \"copies\"—could you explain why pandas even makes that distinction? like, why can't it just automatically handle the assignment without the warning popping up? what's the actual risk of it being a view instead of a copy?",
      "source": "evaluator"
